{"id":"mandi_bula","lemma":"mandíbula","pos":"noun","rank":4327,"glosses":["jaw, mandible"],"ipa":"/manˈdibula/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mandíbulas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/61/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-mand%C3%ADbula.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me duele la mandíbula.","en":"My jaw hurts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438318","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to hurt","l":"doler"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Mi mandíbula me duele.","en":"My jaw is sore.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441182","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to hurt","l":"doler"}]},{"text":"Se rompió la mandíbula y perdió algunos dientes.","en":"He got a broken jaw and lost some teeth.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to break","l":"romper"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},{"g":"tooth","l":"diente"}]},{"text":"La mandé un puñetazo a la mandíbula.","en":"I punched his jaw.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to send","l":"mandar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"punch with the fist"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}